  <h2 id="latest-result-title">vLLM on Apple Silicon</h2>
  <p style="margin:0;color:var(--ink-muted);max-width:42rem;">
    vLLM vs plain Transformers on an Apple Silicon Mac: same model, same questions, honest numbers.
  </p>

