  <p style="margin:0;color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:0.95rem;">
    Median of 3 runs. Machine: MacBook Pro, Apple M5 Pro, 24&nbsp;GB. Model: SmolLM2-360M-Instruct (bfloat16).
    At 100 requests together, median throughput was about 23× the sequential Transformers run.
  </p>

  <div class="caveats" role="note">
